The reader thread asks the driver for a frame in a loop. When the driver is
not open, the driver answers with an exception at once, and the loop asks
again at once: a device whose HDMI-CEC driver could not be opened (the virtual
machine has no CEC adapter) had one CPU busy with it for as long as it ran.
The loop now waits 100 ms after such an answer.

Upstream-Status: Pending

